        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frank Darabont\n- TV Series: The Walking Dead\n- Characters: Morales\n- Episodes: \"Vatos\"\n- Works: The Mist, Hearts in Atlantis\n\nFacts:\n- Frank Darabont is a Hungarian-born American film director.\n- Frank Darabont is known for adapting Stephen King novellas to the screen.\n- Frank Darabont directed The Mist and Hearts in Atlantis.\n- Frank Darabont developed the TV series The Walking Dead.\n- Frank Darabont created the character Morales for The Walking Dead.\n- Morales appeared in the The Walking Dead episode \"Vatos\".",
